        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "大坑依間串燒店真係好正🤤🔥！每一串串燒都燒到位，外層微焦帶香，入面保持 juicy，味道層次好豐富，完全食得出師傅火候同心機！\n\nGreat atmosphere, friendly service, and top-notch food. Tai Hang always has gems, and this place is definitely one of them.\nHighly recommended — I will 100% come back! 🔥\nYou can really taste the chef’s skills and control of the grill.😍",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
